    <ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl id="f-49" contextRef="c-29">ET Gathering &amp; Processing LLC ("ET GP") is a direct wholly-owned subsidiary of ET Midstream Holdings LLC, a direct wholly-owned subsidiary of Energy Transfer LP ("Energy Transfer"). On September 7, 2023, to facilitate an internal corporate reorganization, ETC Texas Pipeline, Ltd. ("ETC Texas") and ET GP, both indirect wholly-owned subsidiaries of Energy Transfer, entered into a plan of merger pursuant to which (a) all right, title and interest in and to all of the assets, contracts, rights and liabilities related to the ETC Texas gathering and processing business, other than the assets located in or around Tilden, Texas and the associated rights and liabilities of those assets are vested in ET GP; (b) all right, title and interest in and to those assets located in or around Tilden, Texas and the associated rights and liabilities of those assets, including any contracts, rights and liabilities related to the Tilden assets remain with ETC Texas; and (c) ETC Texas and ET GP survived the merger which was effective October 1, 2023.</ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl>
    <ferc:OfficerTitle id="f-50" contextRef="c-29">Group Senior Vice President and Controller</ferc:OfficerTitle>
